this is different from intrinsics. Intrinsics are JDK class methods that are directly
converted to machine code instructions by C1 (as compared to native calls that are replaced
with native OS calls)

These are however not official Java bytecode instructions.

for e.g.,
sun.misc.Unsafe.java => public final native boolean compareAndSwapObject

is implemented as an intrinsic. The list of all intrinsics can be found under
hotspot/src/share/vm/classfile/vmSymbols.hpp
